<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>SAN
RAFAEL, BULACAN, PHILIPPINES, Sept. 10, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- </B>One and One Green Technologies, Inc. (Nasdaq: YDDL) (&ldquo;One
and One&rdquo; or the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;), a Philippines-based recycler of non-ferrous metals and industrial materials, today
announced the Company&rsquo;s participation in the H.C. Wainwright 28th Annual Global Investment Conference, taking place September
14-16, 2026 at the Lotte New York Palace Hotel in New York City.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
H.C. Wainwright Annual Global Investment Conference is a premier event that brings together corporate leaders, institutional investors,
and industry experts from around the world to explore emerging trends, investment opportunities, and strategic insights across a wide
range of sectors, including Life Sciences, FinTech, Metals &amp; Mining, Technology/Media/Telecom &amp; Growth, and Cleantech. The conference
features company presentations, one-on-one investor meetings, and keynote addresses. Held annually in New York City, the conference has
become a key destination for global investors seeking to discover high-growth potential companies. Learn more about the event at&nbsp;https://hcwevents.com/annualconference.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Ms.
Tina Yan, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, and Willis Wong, Chief Financial Officer, will be available for meetings with investors
during the conference. Investors interested in scheduling a meeting should contact their H.C. Wainwright representative or email&nbsp;meetings@hcwco.com.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;The
Philippines sits at the center of a growing regional flow of electronic waste and scrap metal, and our licensed import and processing
platform is built to convert that material into copper and aluminum products manufacturers actually need,&rdquo; said Ms. Tina Yan, Chairman
and Chief Executive Officer of One and One. &ldquo;H.C. Wainwright brings the right audience together for our company, and we intend
to use these meetings to build direct relationships with U.S. institutional investors who follow the metals and cleantech sectors.&rdquo;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

