<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">One
and One Green Technologies, Inc. is a licensed hazardous waste importer and a licensed recycler of non-ferrous metals and industrial
materials in the Philippines. One and One transforms electronic waste, scrap metal and other raw materials into high-value products,
including copper alloy ingots and aluminum scraps. With significant permitted annual processing capacity and advanced processing capabilities,
One and One provides economical, flexible and environmentally responsible recycling solutions to manufacturers and industrial clients
across domestic and international markets. One and One is strategically positioned to meet the growing demand for sustainable resource
management.</FONT></P>

